<contentList>
	<content contentuid="hbe9d9a3bg109ag4289g8e58gad52bd6b65f6" version="1">夸塞魔，葬火孽裔</content>
	<content contentuid="he00eb74bg7040g4ce9gb748g76e6e2e5b708" version="1">觀察者眼魔，葬火孽裔</content>
	<content contentuid="hb3c0a31fg21afg4080g8a72gaa09416cf63d" version="1">攫取</content>
	<content contentuid="h2b5f6531g50f6g4a22ga4f6gbd67944a6052" version="1">將魔法從目標手中奪走。目標失去&lt;LSTag Tooltip="Concentration"&gt;專注&lt;/LSTag&gt;、&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="HASTE"&gt;加速&lt;/LSTag&gt;和&lt;LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="BLESS"&gt;祝福&lt;/LSTag&gt;。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRolls"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;與&lt;LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow"&gt;豁免檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;都攔不住這個小賊！</content>
	<content contentuid="ha195493ag17a2g4b25g984bgc696d7334a1e" version="1">掠奪所得</content>
	<content contentuid="h19af596cgf051g47ffga234g778a8a389c96" version="1">帶著奪來的東西離開。&lt;LSTag Tooltip="MovementSpeed"&gt;移動速度&lt;/LSTag&gt;提高&lt;b&gt;[1]&lt;/b&gt;，&lt;LSTag Tooltip="AttackRolls"&gt;攻擊檢定&lt;/LSTag&gt;獲得&lt;b&gt;+[2]&lt;/b&gt;加值。</content>
	<content contentuid="h74f7a749gfd1cg4c4bgbbe4g9d4a6ba98a76" version="1">不穩定的存在</content>
	<content contentuid="haed43f92ge7a9g4cacgaee8gc59dec296afc" version="1">這隻位面生物無法長時間停留在物質位面，當此狀態結束時便會消失。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha79e2688g0ee7g41d6ga492g77e469f1af3c" version="1">伯巴朗，葬火孽裔</content>
	<content contentuid="h16a35cd2g4bc2g427cgb483g1e9d416bca80" version="1">葬火：過早召喚</content>
	<content contentuid="h8dc3d65eg0dc6g416ag8dbfg4577495b8fb6" version="1">葬火在隊伍足夠強大之前便召來了這頭生物，穿越讓它變得虛弱。</content>
</contentList>
